## 4. External IP Connectivity Test

Command:

`ping 8.8.8.8`

Results:

`Packets Sent: 4`  
`Packets Received: 4`  
`Packet Loss: 0%`

Observed latency:

`Minimum: 12 ms`  
`Maximum: 19 ms`  
