# VirtualBox NAT

The lab VM used Oracle VirtualBox NAT networking.

Simplified traffic flow:

`Windows 11 VM`

↓

`Private VirtualBox network`

↓

`10.0.2.2 NAT gateway`

↓

`Host/network`

↓

`Internet`

The successful gateway and external-IP tests demonstrated that traffic could pass from the VM through the VirtualBox NAT environment to an external network.

