## Key Learning

The most important lesson from this lab was to troubleshoot network problems **in stages rather than guessing the cause**.

My standard approach is:

> **Configuration → Local → Gateway → External IP → DNS**

Each successful test rules out part of the network path and helps narrow down where a fault is occurring.
